{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1","mirrow":false,"x":310,"trans":true,"y":-286,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":310,"trans":true,"y":-286,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]很好啊，能在野外搭建一个功能齐全而且很舒适的营地，{myName}很厉害啊！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]而且看起来非常坚挺，完全可以住个十几年。不像我以前在野外搭的营地，一点小雨就被毁掉了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]不过这个营地还是有一点不足的，那就是……训练的器材还是太少了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]你看看，这里的木桩完全不经打嘛，还有这里的树干，扒一下就断了，根本没法做引体向上这类训练。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]不过放心吧！我来了之后，一定会给营地带来更多的训练设备，让这里的伙伴都能得到充分的锻炼，然后以钢铁之躯应对那些凶狠的魔物！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"乌帕","text":"[show]要不……就先从准备一百个负重木桩开始？{myName}要和我一起来吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara033_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":300,"x":310,"trans":true,"y":-286,"noOut":false,"addImg":"chara033_1_face_chara033_1a","scaleY":1,"noIn":false,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"sj_033_01","des":"天数事件-乌帕01"}